{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up alone in a hostile, stylized world\u2014raw stone, strange architecture, and wild creatures all around. With just your wits, you must <strong>survive another night</strong>.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/Facephoto.jpg?t=1752689609\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is out to get you: Rogues roam the ruins with guns, dinosaur-like predators stalk the forests, and lethal wildlife senses every mistake. Whether you're alone or playing with up to three friends, <strong>your survival depends on smarts, teamwork, and preparation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Landiscape</strong> drops you into the unknown:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong> tools, weapons, and gear from scrap and ancient tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your base</strong>\u2014fencing, defenses, hideouts\u2014anywhere you can survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight against dynamic AI</strong> that patrols, coordinates, and pushes back hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt and evade wildlife</strong>: from pack hunters to territorial dino-beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo or co\u2011op</strong> for up to four players; find allies or go it alone, but nothing here is safe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources. Secure territory. Build a shelter\u2014or a fortress. Hope friends don\u2019t betray you, and trust your instincts when darkness falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because in the end, <strong>everything wants you to die</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1752689609","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/a